{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation pushed to Gerrit change 2831. RCA: plan-review close recheck ran before close-class/reason-backed administrative disposition evidence was validated/threaded, so task --class obsolete --reason fell through to a normal plan-review attestation check and failed unsigned. RED: tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py::test_open_task_obsolete_close_bypasses_plan_review_close_gate failed before the fix with the plan-review attestation error. Fix: validate close-class evidence before the close gate, pass close_reason into the plan-review close check, reuse close_disposition.verdict as the evidence predicate, and preserve normal completed-work close gating. Validation: focused close-gate suite passed; make verify passed with GIT_CONFIG_* unset."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788868211950620001,"uuid":"730a7d91-d568-4cee-97a3-86016667f7b5"}